# Manifold level 10
# The towers (stage 5n, decision 0031): the wall's third section, at half past five. A yard between two
# towers; sentries and a caster at its far end. In the west tower, the crossbow and grenades; behind it, a
# room a button opens. In the east tower, the yellow key: and those who charge (quick, with sticks: turn
# and meet them) come in from the yard when one takes it. The yellow door, north: the hall to the gate,
# and more who charge. Drawn as a plan (plans/level-3.plan).
title The towers
spawn 0 1 1
facing 0 0 -1
ambient 0.32
sky 5.5

